---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// What the CPU profile and fgprof each count for main.(*server).report (real shares, Go 1.27.1).
const W = 900;
const H = 300;
---
<figure class="gp18f">
  <div class="gp18f-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: one GET /report request is about 20 milliseconds of wall time, almost all of it parked in a wait and a tiny slice running on the CPU. Bottom: the CPU profile puts 0.41 percent of its samples in main.(*server).report, while fgprof puts 13.90 percent of its samples there.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One GET /report request, about 20 ms of wall time</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một request GET /report, khoảng 20 ms thời gian thực</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="20" y="42" width="8" height="34" class="run" />
    <rect x="28" y="42" width="852" height="34" rx="3" class="wait" />
    <DiagramIcon name="idle" x={300} y={59} size={24} />
    <DiagramIcon name="cpu" x={44} y={93} size={24} />
    <text x="64" y="98" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>running on a CPU</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đang chạy trên CPU</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="320" y="64" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>goroutine parked, waiting (time.Sleep stands in for a slow dependency)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>goroutine đang đỗ chờ (time.Sleep thay cho một dịch vụ phụ thuộc chậm)</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="20" x2="880" y1="118" y2="118" class="rule" />
    <text x="20" y="146" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Share of each profile that lands in main.(*server).report</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Phần của mỗi profile rơi vào main.(*server).report</tspan>
    </text>

    <DiagramIcon name="cpu" x={32} y={186} size={24} />
    <text x="52" y="190" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>CPU profile</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>CPU profile</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="150" y="174" width="12.3" height="24" rx="2" class="hot fm-pulse" />
    <text x="176" y="191" class="body num">
      <tspan data-lang-en>0.41%  (0.01 s of 2.46 s)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>0,41%  (0,01 s trên 2,46 s)</tspan>
    </text>

    <DiagramIcon name="stopwatch" x={32} y={234} size={24} />
    <text x="52" y="238" class="body">fgprof</text>
    <rect x="150" y="222" width="417" height="24" rx="3" class="bar fm-glow" />
    <text x="580" y="239" class="body num">
      <tspan data-lang-en>13.90%  (6.94 s of 49.93 s)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>13,90%  (6,94 s trên 49,93 s)</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Real shares from the CPU profile and the fgprof capture in this post. The two totals differ (2.46 s of CPU samples against 49.93 s of goroutine time), so compare the percentages, not the seconds. The top strip is not to scale.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tỉ lệ thật từ CPU profile và bản capture fgprof trong bài. Hai tổng khác nhau (2,46 s mẫu CPU so với 49,93 s thời gian goroutine), nên hãy so phần trăm, đừng so số giây. Thanh phía trên không vẽ đúng tỉ lệ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp18f { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp18f-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp18f svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .gp18f text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp18f .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp18f .body { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp18f .m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp18f .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp18f .wait { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .gp18f .run { fill: var(--gold); }
  .gp18f .bar { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gp18f .hot { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp18f .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp18f figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
